issue_context.body:
### Description
Property of type System.Version serialized successfully, but on deserialization it returns empty object (in sample below Ver1 = 0.0.0.0)

public class TestClass
{
    public Version Ver1 { get; set; }
}


var ver = new TestClass
{
    Ver1 = new Version(1, 3, 4, 6)
}

string serialized = JsonSerializer.Serialize(ver);    // returns {"Ver1":"Major":1,"Minor":3,"Build":4,"Revision":6,"MajorRevision":0,"MinorRevision":6}}

TestClass deser = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<TestClass>(serialized);    // Ver1 is 0.0

### Configuration
Windows 10 2004 X64
.NET Core 3.1.7
